  "notes": "FORMS:\n{寂|さび}しい (lonely - adjective) + さ (nominalizing suffix)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {寂|さび}しさを{感|かん}じる (to feel loneliness)\n- {寂|さび}しさに{耐|た}える (to endure loneliness)\n- {寂|さび}しさを{紛|まぎ}らわす (to distract from loneliness)\n- {寂|さび}しさを{埋|う}める (to fill the loneliness)\n\nVARIANT:\n{淋|さび}しさ is an alternative kanji spelling with the same meaning.\n\nRELATED EMOTIONS:\n- {孤独|こどく} (solitude, isolation)\n- {切|せつ}なさ (bittersweetness, sadness)\n- {虚|むな}しさ (emptiness)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {寂|さび}しい (lonely - adjective)\n- {孤独感|こどくかん} (feeling of loneliness)\n- {郷愁|きょうしゅう} (nostalgia, homesickness)",
